**W020** · Unrecognized field

unrecognized field 'depends_on' on entity 'beta' of kind 'behavior' at a.spec

An entity sets a field that isn't declared for its kind by any installed extension. Remove the field, fix a typo in its name, or install the extension that declares it.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#w020)

---

**W006** · Behavior missing category

behavior 'beta' has no category — agents use category for task routing

A `behavior` entity has no `category` field, which agents rely on for task routing. Add a `category` field to the behavior.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#w006)

---

**E006** · Missing required field

behavior 'beta' is missing required field 'contract'

An entity is missing a field marked `required: true` for its kind in the field registry. Add the missing field to the entity.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#e006)

